{"term": {"label": "愛", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "亡", "id": "亡"}, {"form": "勇", "id": "勇"}, {"form": "告", "id": "吿"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "喜", "id": "喜"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大王", "id": "大王"}, {"form": "好", "id": "好"}, {"form": "寡人", "id": "寡人"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "愛", "variants": [], "id": "愛"}, {"form": "昔", "id": "昔"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "治", "id": "治"}, {"form": "獵", "id": "獵"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "田", "id": "田"}, {"form": "耕", "id": "耕"}, {"form": "色", "id": "色"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}, {"form": "貨", "id": "貨"}, {"form": "鼓", "id": "鼓"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.2900063107871858, "source": "問", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 2.423537703411708, "source": "問", "target": "昔"}, {"weight": 2.2359390895169096, "source": "勇", "target": "好"}, {"weight": 1.5968591302272404, "source": "勇", "target": "寡人"}, {"weight": 1.8845412026790211, "source": "勇", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.0860335064612496, "source": "勇", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.69547141889535, "source": "勇", "target": "請"}, {"weight": 1.3072258376441974, "source": "好", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.1373268008488, "source": "好", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 0.4441796202888547, "source": "好", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.425008873300581, "source": "好", "target": "寡人"}, {"weight": 0.7318616927406357, "source": "好", "target": "鼓"}, {"weight": 1.1373268008488, "source": "好", "target": "獵"}, {"weight": 1.1373268008488, "source": "好", "target": "田"}, {"weight": 0.3263965846324714, "source": "好", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.1373268008488,